WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.997
Everyone celebrates the day a target is met.

00:00:04.297 --> 00:00:05.557
I study the day after.

00:00:06.157 --> 00:00:09.927
Dr Joost Nwosu is a Postdoctoral Fellow at Slop University.

00:00:10.527 --> 00:00:11.857
Some targets are retired.

00:00:12.057 --> 00:00:16.007
A community choir retires a song once it ends in tune three times in a row.

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:17.797
Some get quietly tougher.

00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:21.257
A school sausage sizzle gets under the shire's limit of sixty,

00:00:21.407 --> 00:00:22.507
so the shire lowers it.

00:00:23.007 --> 00:00:24.427
And some stay on as a floor.

00:00:24.627 --> 00:00:26.507
A young swimmer sets a personal best,

00:00:26.657 --> 00:00:29.187
and every slower swim is logged as a shortfall.

00:00:29.787 --> 00:00:33.957
He is now the best-funded researcher in the School of Continuous Improvement.

00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:35.957
More than a million dollars.

00:00:36.157 --> 00:00:38.167
Two hundred and forty-four research outputs.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.132
And eleven hundred citations.

00:00:40.932 --> 00:00:42.102
Read his work on our website,

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:43.312
catch us on Bluesky,

00:00:43.462 --> 00:00:44.282
or write to us.
